T*
(ACME PETROCHEMICAL DEMO COMPLEX - UNIT 2300) Tj
T*
(PIPING & INSTRUMENTATION DIAGRAM: SIS CAUSE & EFFECT INTERLOCK MATRIX) Tj
T*
(Drawing Number: PID-23-0002 | Revision: Z1 | Safety Integrity Level: SIL-2 \(IEC 61511\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. INTERLOCK I-2304: DECOMPOSER REACTOR D-2304 EXOTHERMIC RUNAWAY PROTECTION \(SIL-2\)) Tj
T*
(Initiating Causes \(Any of the following\):) Tj
T*
(- Cause 1A: D-2304 Reactor Temperature High-High TXSHH-1301 >= 115.0 degC \(2oo3 voting TXSHH-1301A/B/C\)) Tj
T*
(- Cause 1B: D-2304 Reactor Pressure High-High PAHH-1301 >= 5.5 kg/cm2g \(PT-1301\)) Tj
T*
(- Cause 1C: D-2304 Recirculation Flow Low-Low FSLL-1304 <= 110,000 kg/hr \(FT-1304\)) Tj
T*
(Automated Trip Effects \(Executed within <= 2.0 seconds\):) Tj
T*
(- Effect 1: Trip close Sulfuric Acid Catalyst Isolation Valve XV-1305 \(stops acid catalyst feed Stream S310\)) Tj
T*
(- Effect 2: Trip open Emergency Cumene Quench Valve XV-1309 \(injects cold cumene Stream S387 into D-2304 to dilute CHP < 15 wt% and quench temperature < 65 degC\)) Tj
T*
(- Effect 3: Trip stop Preflash Column Bottoms Pump P-2301A/B \(stops concentrated 82 wt% CHP feed Stream S229\)) Tj
T*
(- Effect 4: Force E-2307 Cooling Water Control Valve TV-1302 to 100% Open \(FO\)) Tj
T*
ET
